  (text "J701 Micro-Fit 430450200: pin 1 PROP_RAW, pin 2 paired GND.\nDistinct from 4-contact propulsion input. This is not a charging connector.\nThe provisional ~3 A aggregate limit does not allocate unspecified valve loads."
    (at 25.4 101.6 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "27b36bf7-9b44-423a-9d9c-da4c0c0510ee"))
  (text "WHAT THE PROPULSION BOARD MUST HANDLE"
    (at 25.4 139.7 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.7 1.7))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "a867f507-12f1-4a8c-b7ee-a4de63828cc4"))
  (text "Local regulators, valve switching, state machine, permissives and physical hazardous-energy isolation.\nNo Churro MCU, CAN endpoint or independent-recovery supply."
    (at 25.4 154.94 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "75e04012-0c37-44df-be8b-2dd7364ee624"))
  (text "SERVICE AND CHARGING / choices still depend on the packs, chargers and valve coils"
    (at 25.4 190.5 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.7 1.7))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "b14885d6-40a1-4263-a99d-7e24a89e6900"))
  (text "Regulated 24 V actuator converter remains conditional on confirmed coil schedule.\nCharging uses external matched balance chargers and separately fused passive service harnesses.\nCharge connections join upstream of discharge protection; physical charge/arm exclusion remains required.\nNeither charging nor propulsion current passes through Burrito."
    (at 25.4 208.28 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "1cc941db-f060-4a4e-a2cc-26604d2962a5"))
  (wire
    (pts
      (xy 93.98 73.66)
      (xy 144.78 73.66))
    (stroke
      (width 0.0)
      (type default))
    (uuid "7122b11c-f35d-4eb3-ac0a-fe5eba36c701"))
  (wire
    (pts
      (xy 93.98 76.2)
      (xy 144.78 76.2))
    (stroke
      (width 0.0)
      (type default))
    (uuid "2c9e99ee-d0d7-4417-a85a-9da455f7deb2"))
  (text "J701 sends the 6S branch to the propulsion board after protection on f02 and the current shunt on f02a.\nIt carries load power and its return. Valve decisions, local supplies and hazardous-energy isolation\nbelong to propulsion, not to Churro. The service and charging boundary is recorded below."
    (at 25.4 30.48 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "29cded47-9746-419e-a39c-8512cb63c86d")))
